                                                "text": "2018. Borger, Julian (1 December 2018). \"G20 agreement backs 'rules-based' order but bows to Trump on trade reforms\". The Guardian. London, United Kingdom. ISSN 0261-3077.\nSherpas from the European Union and 19 countries worked through the week to salvage a meaningful joint statement, culminating in an all-night session on Friday."
